Package: linthesia-studio
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, linthesia-studio-data (= ${source:Version}), python3, ffmpeg, fonts-freefont-ttf
Recommends: kdialog | zenity
Suggests: fluid-soundfont-gm
Provides: linthesia
Conflicts: linthesia
Replaces: linthesia
Description: piano and MIDI practice game with optional 3D visualisations
 Linthesia - Studio extends the free Linthesia piano learning game.
 It offers MIDI playback, a 88-key on-screen keyboard, two-hand practice,
 instrument selection from SoundFont banks, and falling-note views.
 .
 Three-dimensional scenes and video export are available on systems with
 compatible OpenGL drivers. External MIDI hardware is optional.

Package: linthesia-studio-data
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: architecture-independent graphics and stage resources for Linthesia - Studio
 Resources for the Linthesia - Studio interactive piano practice application,
 including editable and high-definition MIDI stage graphics and 3D models.
 .
 This package provides the runtime data used by the separately compiled
 linthesia-studio executable.
